{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07600","headline":"早春过七岭寄题硖石裴丞厅壁 · 萧颖士","name":"早春过七岭寄题硖石裴丞厅壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出硖寄趣少，晚行偏忆君。\n依然向来处，官路谿边云。\n兹路岂不剧，能无俗累纷。\n槐阴永未合，泉声细犹闻。\n弥叹春罢酒，牵卑从此分。\n登高望城入，斜影半风薰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧颖士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}